OL,4,BPochettino's first Man Utd training    
OL,5,Bsession filmed by drone operator       
OL,6,GManchester United fans have been given 
OL,7,Ga unique and unexpected insight into   
OL,8,GMauricio Pochettino's first training   
OL,9,Gsession after footage was captured by  
OL,10,Ga drone flown next to the club's       
OL,11,GCarrington training ground.            
OL,13,FTwelve minutes of the session was      
OL,14,Ffilmed by a drone operator and         
OL,15,Fuploaded onto YouTube.                 
OL,17,FPochettino and his players, who were   
OL,18,Fsplit into three groups, are clearly   
OL,19,Fvisible, with the session filmed from  
OL,20,Fa variety of angles and distances.     
